               "username": "Bored_Dragon",
               "warningSpoilers": false,
               "date": "19 October 2018",
               "rate": "9",
               "title": "\"Undoubtedly the best train film ever made\"",
               "content": "I do not like silent movies, but this one held my attention from the beginning to the end. I was so preoccupied with it that I didn't even smoke one cigarette. Train chasing during the civil war in America, a comedy that deserves at least 7/10 at today's standards, and considering that this is a silent film from 1926...9/10"
