               "content": "Gone with the Wind is a superb piece of cinema shot in a beautiful way like no other film, a great story with amazing performances all around. A film about love, perseverance, deception, and tragedy. This film captures the pure attitude and idea of the south after the civil war and during the reconstruction period. It captivates you from beginning to end."
