               "rate": "10",
               "title": "Fantasy Classic",
               "content": "The Wizard of Oz is a long time favorite of mine. One I used to watch every Easter with my family. It is a delightful classic film.This film I believe most all movie watchers have seen and have drawn their own conclusions as to whether or not they like the film.I know of hard-core blood and gore fans that enjoys The Wizard of Oz due to it's darker tones (witches, wizards and evil flying monkeys). And there are others that I know of that prefer a more \"wholesome\" style to their films which include this movie. Really this film brings together people who are basically different from each other - from hard-cores all the way to wholesome - not many movies have this capability.10/10"
