               "title": "Fabulous.",
               "content": "Singin' in The Rain remains one of the most entertaining and uplifting films of all time. It's become a Christmas must watch, and this year was no different, after a disappointing 2021 schedule, it was made all the better by this magical film.It looks fabulous, made all the way back in 1952, it is beautifully filmed, directed and acting. It's an iconic film for good reason, no matter what mood you're in, this film has the ability to lift your mood, and bring a smile to your face.Kelly's dance remains one of the best scenes ever to grace the big screens.A magical film, 10/10."
