               "rate": "9",
               "title": "Fantastic Surreal Comedy",
               "content": "Fantastic; IMO better than the Holy Grail. Just like that movie most of the comedy is based on surreal circumstances and irrational behavior, and they way the present it and act unexpectedly is what causes the laughs. This movie seemed to hove more of a complete plot than Holy Grail did. There's no cut-off ending, and they call back to old elements in a more natural way. Overall, top tier comedy movie."
