               "username": "Ruskington",
               "warningSpoilers": false,
               "date": "8 December 2020",
               "rate": "10",
               "title": "Quite possibly the greatest war movie ever made",
               "content": "Astounding piece of cinema, presenting the horrors of war in a particular powerful way. Amazing use of colour and tone. Unlike other films in this genre, there is a real sense of humanity. Might well be the greatest film I'll only be able to watch once."
