               "title": "A Drenched & Decrepit Dystopia...",
               "content": "If your curse is accelerated decrepitude, longevity is something that's clearly not accrued, you'll be treated like a slave, when equality is all you crave, in the catastrophic climate you've been skewed.If you try to break the rules and integrate, the only recourse left to them is based on hate, where you're hunted like a dog, through the streets of rain and smog, unavoidably it's time to abdicate.Oozing metaphors from almost every pore, the dreams of unicorns lay behind several locked doors."
