               "username": "rrfpaf-99858",
               "warningSpoilers": false,
               "date": "6 February 2021",
               "rate": "7",
               "title": "Just an average family story. Well, on LSD.",
               "content": "At first I thought Spirited Away was weird. So imagine spirited away, but with no real plot. I'm telling you, this movie is just weird weird weird. It doesn't help that the Totoro and the cat have really creepy smiles. Don't get me wrong, I enjoyed every moment of it! The kids are freaking adorable, the creatures are interesting, and the whole thing left me smiling. But dang that's a weird movie."
