               "date": "30 June 2019",
               "rate": "10",
               "title": "Beautiful.",
               "content": "It'll blow you away with its realism. This film presents the awkward, spontaneous, and genuine moments that real relationships have. It felt as if was watching two real people fall in love. Loved every minute of it...the philosophical conversations fascinated me. 1000% my favorite romance movie of all time because of its realism. This is a truly fantastical film that inspires you to find love."
