               "date": "14 March 2020",
               "rate": "10",
               "title": "Might be my Favorite Movie",
               "content": "So I just saw Snatch and it might be my favorite movie I've ever seen. It is filled with so much fun and funny moments that it made the film so enjoyable to the point where it made me want to write a full review for it. All the cast is great and play their roles really well. The film's comedy is probably the best part about this film. My stomach hurt from laughter because of how funny this film is. This is the end of the non-spoiler section of the review. Another Great part of this movie is the great plot twists especially the one near the end.Overall this movie was great and I loved every moment of itI give Snatch an A+"
