               "content": "POSITIVES:.There are shots in this film that deserve to be framed and put on your wall .Chihiro's relationship with No Face pulls at the heart strings (especially the bath tokens scene) .Chihiro's character journey from immature, spoilt brat to mature, strong woman is greatNEGATIVES:.From the incredible critical acclaim this film has I'm sure there are very deep themes but I clearly missed them .Chihiro is very annoying at the start of the film and her parents are awful! .The best plot twists are when the evidence had already been seen, just not pieced together. The twist in this film that Haku is really a river that saved Chihiro when she was a little girl comes out of absolutely nowhere and that is not a good plot twist .Chihiro gets extreme prejudice in the bath house because she is human but plenty of other characters appear to be human but get no hate?"
