               "warningSpoilers": false,
               "date": "7 October 2019",
               "rate": "10",
               "title": "MASTERPIECE",
               "content": "It is just what you want for the best movie. Great story great acting, thrilling twist. Just watched Joker in 2019, I just has to come back and give dark knight a 10. And thanks to Heath Ledger for the exceptional performs."
