               "date": "9 December 2020",
               "rate": "9",
               "title": "Christopher Nolan back at it again.",
               "content": "What can I say, it was made by Christopher Nolan so it has to be good. Amazing action. Amazing characters. Amazing director. The Dark Knight has everything. I have no problems with this movie. But the thing keeping me back from giving this movie a 10 is that something about it just didn't fully connect with me.Overall rating: 9.4."
