               "content": "This is a movie that you can watch over and over very rich in details never gets old, cast was awesome and of course. Martin Scorsese delivers again awesome director, there is no bad guys just a lot of dysfunctional characters is like high school for adults.Funny intriguing, sexy and best of all based on a real life event makes it even better and of course as a man I love the naked women but that is not why I gave it a 10 it was well written and executed.This movie is like the boiler room/wall street films on steroids, makes those other films look like kitty movies.It is impossible but I wish they make a sequel or a tv show about it."
