               "date": "26 May 2022",
               "rate": "10",
               "title": "Let me just say...",
               "content": "I was reluctantly dragged into the theater, thinking that they didn't need to make a Top Gun 2 and that the first one was where that story needed to end.I could write a couple paragraphs to summarize my feelings after walking out of the theater, but I'm going to leave it with just one sentence.I was wrong."
