               "content": "Greetings from Lithuania.I wasn't the biggest fan of first \"Top Gun\" movie. I saw it like 5 years ago so for me it wasn't nostalic or anything. It was just OK movie and nothing more.Today i saw \"Top Gun: Maverick\" (2022) in cinema. And it blew me away. This movie was incredible. It literally put a smile on my face. Action scenes in the air were the best i ever saw of this type of action. Directing by Joseph Kosinski was perfect. Music was on spot. Cinematography was gorgeous. I loved how actually calm and quite this movie was, until it wasn't and transition between scenes, acts, calm and action was perfect. Acting was great. This is a movie making as good as it gets. Was it predictable? Yes. But at the same time i was excited and glued to the screen during its whole 2 hours run time.Overall, \"Top Gun: Maverick\" is a Hollywood blockbuster done right. Its a Hollywood action adventure movie in every possible way, yet this time its done incredibly good. What a terrific sequel."
