               "content": "The film opens introducing three characters. Carroll Shelby (Matt Damon) only America to win Le Mans is forced from racing because of his heart. He is selling cars. Ken Miles (Christian Bale ) is a savvy independent race car driver with an attitude and no sponsors. The IRS just took his garage. Lee Iococca (Jon Bernthal) is attempting to convince Henry Ford II that if Ford can win Le Mans, it will sell cars. The three of them come together to try to make it happen.A well acted film with the right blend of drama, comedy, and action."
